@namespace DotNetNuke.Modules.Journal
@inherits DotNetNuke.UI.DnnComponentBase

@*
    Replaces JournalList.cs (a System.Web.UI.WebControls.WebControl whose
    Render(HtmlTextWriter) override wrote the literal text "Hello World" and nothing else -
    no surrounding <span>, because the override did not call base.Render).

    The output below is byte-identical to that. The designer-only [DefaultProperty("Text")] and
    [ToolboxData(...)] attributes were dropped: they only fed the Visual Studio WebForms designer,
    which has no Blazor equivalent. The four public properties are preserved in
    JournalList.razor.cs.
*@
Hello World
